   "he": "מַתְנִי׳ לְעוֹלָם נִמְנִין עָלָיו עַד שֶׁיִּהְיֶה בּוֹ כְּזַיִת לְכׇל אֶחָד וְאֶחָד. נִמְנִין וּמוֹשְׁכִין אֶת יְדֵיהֶן מִמֶּנּוּ עַד שֶׁיִּשָּׁחֵט. רַבִּי שִׁמְעוֹן אוֹמֵר: עַד שֶׁיִּזָּרֵק אֶת הַדָּם.",
   "en": "«MISHNA:» Additional people «can always be registered for» a Paschal lamb, «as long as there will be» at least «an olive-bulk» of the lamb’s meat «for each and every» person registered. People «can be registered and withdraw themselves from» being registered for a Paschal lamb «until it is slaughtered. Rabbi Shimon says:» Even «until» the priest «sprinkles the blood.»"
  }
